MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 791539569}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e0f00d35251544ab58014922c9c9125c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PocketPlanet.NpcCharacterDialogue
  npcName: Warden Nyx
  npcRole: Keeper of the Obsidian Shrine
  isPlanetOneQuestGiver: 0
  isPlanetTwoRecipient: 1
  visualModel: {fileID: 0}
  questMarkerRoot: {fileID: 0}
  initialLines:
  - Hey there, Pip! Our sister sanctuary on the Obsidian Deadwood planet has gone
    dark!
  - Thick violet shadow-fog swallowed their forest, and the ancient Obsidian Shrine
    Lantern is dying.
  - Climb the terraced Starlight Ridge behind the waterfall pond to retrieve the
    golden SOLARIS ASTRAL CORE!
  - Once you have the Core, board the Starhopper Flying Saucer on the launchpad and
    pilot it across the asteroid belt to Warden Nyx!
  reminderLines:
  - The Solaris Astral Core is glowing atop Starlight Ridge to the northeast!
  - Use the Bouncy Jelly-Shrooms along the cliff path, grab the Core, and board the
    Flying Saucer!
  readyToFlyLines:
  - You've got the Solaris Astral Core! Look how warmly it glows!
  - Step up to the Starhopper Flying Saucer on the stone launchpad and press [E]
    to launch into deep space!
